# Memtrain MEG: continuous head position

One file per recording, holding head position over time estimated from the continuous
HPI coils. Load with mne.chpi.read_head_pos().

Columns are time, three rotation quaternion components, the head origin in device
coordinates (metres), goodness of fit, error and velocity. The MaxMovement value in
each raw MEG sidecar is the largest distance the head origin moved from its starting
position, computed from these files.
